WEBVTT

00:17.387 --> 00:21.890
I'm in a room, the lights are dim, the monitors a

00:22.050 --> 00:28.874
steady beep I'm waiting for a bed to open, I'm

00:28.975 --> 00:35.607
trying just to sleep Aubrey's on the vinyl couch

00:36.688 --> 00:41.911
She hasn't left my side I'm starving but the

00:42.051 --> 00:48.596
nurse just said My hands are tied Just me again,

00:48.676 --> 00:53.980
it's midnight now Click, the door swings open

00:54.941 --> 00:57.783
Click, the cuff is on his arm

01:01.305 --> 01:07.710
on him He's just another false alarm He's trying

01:08.011 --> 01:13.895
just to sleep but he isn't P.O. And I have got a

01:13.995 --> 01:21.281
promise that this night will be so slow It feels

01:21.321 --> 01:29.493
like just a minute I start to drift away A hazy,

01:29.633 --> 01:34.876
anxious, fitful dream That's begging me to stay

01:36.778 --> 01:41.801
But then the sound, it pulls me back The lock upon

01:41.841 --> 01:48.206
the door The squeak of shoes upon the floor I

01:48.286 --> 01:54.390
can't take anymore It's just me again, it's 2AM

01:54.890 --> 01:57.853
Click, the door swings open

02:03.748 --> 02:10.072
The light is on him He's just another false alarm

02:10.512 --> 02:17.235
He's trying just to sleep But he isn't P.O. And I

02:17.296 --> 02:22.739
have got a promise That this night will be so slow

02:22.759 --> 02:30.483
I'm not a person, I'm a chart A number on a screen

02:32.753 --> 02:37.334
The most annoying in this night that I have ever

02:37.494 --> 02:41.056
seen

02:41.156 --> 02:46.597
Aubrey's jolting on the sofa She's getting zero

02:46.697 --> 02:53.479
sleep This isn't care, this isn't rest The hole

02:53.519 --> 03:00.001
is way too deep Good morning, it is 6am Click, the

03:00.041 --> 03:01.782
lights are on now

03:07.112 --> 03:08.053
Am I still in P.O.? ?

03:37.860 --> 03:38.040
Huh?

03:42.250 --> 03:42.831
Hungry.

